<title>GERMANY: German state of Bavaria details Nov cost of living.</title>
<headline>German state of Bavaria details Nov cost of living.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Office in the west German state of Bavaria on Monday gave the following breakdown of its November cost of living data :</p>
<p>						 Percentage change</p>
<p> Index/component			   mth/mth   yr/yr    Index</p>
<p> Overall price index		     -0.1	+1.3     114.3</p>
<p> Rents					 +0.2	+3.0     127.6</p>
<p> Personal goods, services and other  +0.1	+0.6     109.9</p>
<p> Transport and communications	  -0.2	+1.5     115.4</p>
<p> Furniture and other household goods +0.1	+0.6     109.9</p>
<p> Foodstuffs, drinks, tobacco	   +0.4	+0.7     108.2</p>
<p> Clothing, shoes			   +0.2	+0.9     107.1</p>
<p> Health and personal care items	+0.1	+1.9     114.1</p>
<p> Education, entertainment, leisure   +0.0	+0.4     109.5</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
